Swept by the central git manager on behalf of Operator Agent#soft-otter, covering 12 path(s) that agent claimed. This entry exists because change.log is append-only and a multi-agent sweep needs one entry per attributed commit - the gate reads the staged set, so a shared entry could only ever cover one group.


